                                                "sense_id": "29a60424-2bf1-3859-a9ab-fd4b2a98fd99",
                                                "text": "Coordinate term: husstuss"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c7eb9be-5750-4ee5-b6ff-6fa48a1f584b",
                                                "sense_id": "29a60424-2bf1-3859-a9ab-fd4b2a98fd99",
                                                "text": "Everyone who comes here and who knows who Blanchard even is would be considered an agp fetishist coomer by Blanchard. Cope harder you malebrained jeep."
